{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>For my feet.</b> On account of my feet, for it is the way of people to say, 'So-and-so has a good foot.' The meaning is: you were blessed from the time I came to your house. The he is added in meaning, and [the form] is thus defective."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:46:24.765552057Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}